---
/* Defranceschi of Fiume — the third family of the name in the Blasonario
   Giuliano (from Sen. Riccardo Gigante's Blasonario Fiumano):

   "Spaccato: nel 1° d'argento alla croce movente dallo spaccato trapassata da
    due freccie poste in sbarra con la punta rivolta in alto, il tutto di
    rosso; nel 2° di verde alla melagrana al naturale; con fascia ristretta
    di rosso sullo spaccato."

   Per fess. In the first, argent, a cross issuing from the line of division
   pierced by two arrows in bend sinister, points upward, the whole gules.
   In the second, vert, a pomegranate proper. A narrow fess gules on the
   division.

   Every element drawn below is named in that blazon and nothing else is
   added. The division sits at the blazoned proportion; the drawing style is
   ours, as any emblazonment's must be. */
const shield = "M14,26 H106 V72 C106,106 84,128 60,141 C36,128 14,106 14,72 Z";
const ARGENT = "#EFEDE6", GULES = "#A62A25", VERT = "#3C6B45",
      FRUIT = "#B33227", CALYX = "#7C9A55", SEED = "#F0DED2";
const FESS = 74;           // the line of division
const helm = "M44,0 C52,-6 68,-6 76,0 C82,5 82,12 79,16 L41,16 C38,12 38,5 44,0 Z";
---
<figure class="armfig">
  <svg viewBox="0 -18 120 172" width="216" role="img"
       aria-label="Per fess: argent, a cross issuing from the division pierced by two arrows in bend sinister points upward, all gules; vert, a pomegranate proper; a narrow fess gules on the division">
    <defs>
      <clipPath id="famclip"><path d={shield}/></clipPath>
      <marker id="ahead" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5"
              markerWidth="3.9" markerHeight="3.9" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 L2.6,5 Z" fill={GULES} stroke="#EFEDE6" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g clip-path="url(#famclip)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="120" height={FESS} fill={ARGENT}/>
      <rect x="0" y={FESS} width="120" height={152 - FESS} fill={VERT}/>

      <!-- the cross, issuing from the line of division -->
      <g fill={GULES}>
        <rect x="52.5" y="22" width="15" height="52"/>
        <rect x="34" y="37" width="52" height="15"/>
      </g>

      <!-- two arrows in bend sinister, passing across the cross, points to chief.
           Outlined argent so that gules-on-gules still reads, as it must on a real shield. -->
      <g stroke-linecap="butt">
        <g stroke={ARGENT} stroke-width="6.2">
          <line x1="24" y1="70" x2="59" y2="34"/>
          <line x1="47" y1="72" x2="82" y2="36"/>
        </g>
        <g stroke={GULES} stroke-width="3.6" marker-end="url(#ahead)">
          <line x1="24" y1="70" x2="59" y2="34"/>
          <line x1="47" y1="72" x2="82" y2="36"/>
        </g>
      </g>

      <!-- the narrow fess on the division -->
      <rect x="0" y={FESS - 3} width="120" height="6" fill={GULES}/>

      <!-- pomegranate proper: split fruit, seeds, calyx crown -->
      <g transform="translate(60,106)">
        <path d="M0,-19 C13,-19 19,-9 19,1 C19,12 10,20 0,20 C-10,20 -19,12 -19,1 C-19,-9 -13,-19 0,-19 Z"
              fill={FRUIT}/>
        <path d="M-7,-25 L-8,-18 L-3,-21 L0,-27 L3,-21 L8,-18 L7,-25 L3,-23 L0,-24 L-3,-23 Z" fill={CALYX}/>
        <path d="M-9,-6 C-6,8 6,8 9,-6 C7,12 -7,12 -9,-6 Z" fill={SEED} opacity=".55"/>
        <g fill={SEED}>
          <circle cx="-5" cy="0" r="2.1"/><circle cx="1" cy="-2" r="2.1"/>
          <circle cx="6" cy="1" r="2.1"/><circle cx="-2" cy="5" r="2.1"/>
          <circle cx="4" cy="7" r="2.1"/><circle cx="-7" cy="6" r="2.1"/>
        </g>
      </g>
    </g>

    <path d={shield} fill="none" style="stroke:var(--ink)" stroke-width="2.4"/>
    <g transform="translate(0,-2)" opacity=".92">
      <path d={helm} style="fill:var(--ink)"/>
      <path d="M41,16 H79 L76,24 H44 Z" style="fill:var(--ink)"/>
      <rect x="46" y="8" width="28" height="3.2" fill={ARGENT} opacity=".6"/>
      <path d="M60,-4 C48,-8 34,-2 33,8 C40,4 50,2 58,4 Z" style="fill:var(--ink)" opacity=".55"/>
      <path d="M60,-4 C72,-8 86,-2 87,8 C80,4 70,2 62,4 Z" style="fill:var(--ink)" opacity=".55"/>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <p class="bl">“Spaccato: nel 1° d'argento alla croce movente dallo spaccato trapassata da due freccie poste in sbarra con la punta rivolta in alto, il tutto di rosso; nel 2° di verde alla melagrana al naturale; con fascia ristretta di rosso sullo spaccato.”</p>
    <p class="at">Per fess: in the first, argent, a cross issuing from the line of division and pierced by two arrows placed in bend sinister with their points upward, the whole gules; in the second, vert, a pomegranate proper; with a narrow fess gules upon the division. <strong>Blasonario Giuliano</strong>, after Sen. Riccardo Gigante's <em>Blasonario Fiumano</em> — the third family named Defranceschi at Fiume.</p>
    <p class="dr">Every charge drawn is named in the blazon; the plumed helm is Carlo's addition, not the armorial's. Tinctures here are the record, not a reading.</p>
    <p class="vd"><span class="chip doc">Blazoned twice, independently</span></p>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
